 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "s01",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "Half a kilometre below the Gulf of Mexico, there are reefs that have never seen the sun. The water here is cold all year.",
   "lead": 0.8,
   "tail": 0.9,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2105.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2105.depth-a527c1895047.png",
    "crop_x": 0.62,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "locked",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 0
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.55
    },
    "seed": 39,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_depth_dark"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s02",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "No light reaches them. The water is cold and still. The corals here are animals, not plants, and they eat what drifts down through the dark, one polyp at a time.",
   "lead": 0.4,
   "tail": 0.8,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2332.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2332.depth-a7aa0a9f629b.png",
    "crop_x": 0.36,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "drift",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 1
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 76,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_feed"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s03",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "In late summer, two thousand nine, a research ship holds its position above them for most of a month. Its robot goes down again and again: to reefs, to oil platforms, and to shipwrecks.",
   "lead": 0.5,
   "tail": 0.7,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2326.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2326.depth-476bf4562293.png",
    "crop_x": 0.4,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "locked",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 0
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.55
    },
    "seed": 40,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_cruise"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s04",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "A remotely operated vehicle works the bottom on a cable. It brings pieces of the reef to the surface. Every piece is labelled, photographed and kept cold.",
   "lead": 0.3,
   "tail": 1.0,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2323.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2323.depth-55fadd8dd2cb.png",
    "crop_x": 0.63,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "push",
     "amount": 0.028,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 1
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 93,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_rov"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s05",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "A brittle star, lifted from the reef, in a dish of cold seawater.",
   "lead": 0.4,
   "tail": 1.0,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2322.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2322.depth-2c9e69a908c0.png",
    "crop_x": 0.42,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "arc",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": -1,
     "handheld": 1
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 12,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "non_factual": true
  },
  {
   "id": "s06",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "Every branch is occupied. Snails, crabs and worms live in the coral the way birds live in a forest. Up close, the reef is less a wall than a tangle.",
   "lead": 0.3,
   "tail": 1.0,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2341.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2341.depth-966a98bb467b.png",
    "crop_x": 0.6,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "drift",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": -1,
     "handheld": 1
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.35,
     "rack_to": 0.7,
     "rack_at": 4.0
    },
    "seed": 59,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "non_factual": true
  },
  {
   "id": "s07",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "Nothing here is in a hurry. Growth here is measured in lifetimes, not seasons.",
   "lead": 0.6,
   "tail": 1.6,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2334.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2334.depth-101bb57a3fb9.png",
    "crop_x": 0.38,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "locked",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 0
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 10,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_growth"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s08",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "Black corals on these slopes have been dated by radiocarbon. The oldest have been growing for at least two thousand years.",
   "lead": 0.3,
   "tail": 1.2,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2328.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2328.depth-0edb618ac626.png",
    "crop_x": 0.66,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "push",
     "amount": 0.025,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 1
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 16,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_age"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s09",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "They add a layer thinner than a human hair each year. A branch as thick as a finger can hold centuries.",
   "lead": 0.4,
   "tail": 1.4,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2338.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2338.depth-40f25e690a23.png",
    "crop_x": 0.44,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "arc",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 1
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 82,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_growth"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s10",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "In twenty ten, oil from a damaged well reached the deep sea. Corals near the well were found coated, and their tissue was dying.",
   "lead": 0.4,
   "tail": 1.0,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2342.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2342.depth-52fa3cbfaf12.png",
    "crop_x": 0.58,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "push",
     "amount": 0.022,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 1
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 89,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_spill"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s11",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "A reef that old does not grow back within a human lifetime.",
   "lead": 0.6,
   "tail": 1.4,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2333.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2333.depth-65b1dedb26e7.png",
    "crop_x": 0.4,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "locked",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 0
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 48,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_age"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "s12",
   "beat": "DOC",
   "text": "Down there, a single year leaves almost no mark. Whatever happens at the surface now, the reef below will be living with it for centuries.",
   "lead": 0.5,
   "tail": 2.0,
   "transition_out": {
    "type": "fade",
    "d": 0.0417
   },
   "module": "scenes/still.js",
   "params": {
    "image": "stills/expl2321.jpg",
    "depth": "stills/expl2321.depth-099830d1a6e2.png",
    "crop_x": 0.62,
    "relief": 0.1,
    "camera": {
     "move": "drift",
     "amount": 0.03,
     "dir": 1,
     "handheld": 1
    },
    "focus": {
     "depth": 0.6
    },
    "seed": 84,
    "subframes": 2
   },
   "claims": [
    "c_age"
   ]
  },
